(property "Description" " | design | Four resistors in series =996 Ω port bleed. Sustained±30V gives0.226W perpart;use≥0.5W ratings at50°C. This defines DC on floating antennas and avoids a bias-reference-induced falseforeign voltage. Ideal50ΩIL≈0.215dB;actualRFloadingmustbeVNAqualified.; First bleed resistor directly at the coax tap. Keep its pads and ground-return geometry short and symmetric; the other three form a series chain, not parallel RF loads." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
